---
/**
 * The Practice (the home view of the client's design, November 1, 2026): the hero with the app preview, why
 * practice, how practice works (the rep circle), the four pathways, the membership and the Club.
 */
import Layout from "../layouts/Practice.astro";
import DualImage from "../components/DualImage.astro";
import { LINKS } from "../config/links";
import AppPhone from "../components/AppPhone.astro";
---
<Layout title="The Practice by InnerBoard" description="You can live the life you want. It just takes practice. A place to practice how you think, lead, and live." path="/">
<section class="view" id="home">
  <div class="hero">
    <div class="wrap hero-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow ruled">Life takes reps.</p>
        <h1>You can live the life you want.<em>It just takes practice.</em></h1>
        <p class="sub">A place to practice how you think, lead, and live.</p>
        <div class="ctas">
          <a class="btn btn-solid" href={LINKS.startPracticing}>Start Practicing <span class="arr">→</span></a>
          <a class="btn btn-line" href={LINKS.quiz}>What are you practicing?</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <AppPhone class="hero-phone" screen="today" width={300} eager alt="The Practice app, Today: the Practice Coach asking what’s on your mind today, Set Up Your Day, the Rep of the Day, and daily habits." />
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="band paper">
    <div class="wrap split">
      <div class="ph photo"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1200" height="900" src="/images/practice/golfer.webp" alt="A golfer standing on the first tee at sunrise, looking out over the course"></div>
      <div class="stack">
        <p class="eyebrow">Why practice</p>
        <h2>Life <em>IS</em> the practice round.</h2>
        <p class="lede">You practice sports, music, and your profession. You train your body.</p>
        <p class="lede">How much of your time goes into practicing your life?</p>
        <p class="lede">Life skills are built the same way, one rep at a time. What you practice, you become.</p>
        <a class="textlink" href="/story">Read the 10 reasons →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="wrap">
      <ul class="skills">
        <li>How to feel fear without letting it decide.</li>
        <li>How to respond when you’re frustrated.</li>
        <li>How to communicate when you’re hurt.</li>
        <li>How to trust yourself when you’re uncertain.</li>
        <li>How to decide when there are no guarantees.</li>
        <li>How to lead yourself when it’s just you.</li>
        <li>How to love the people who matter most.</li>
        <li>How to create results you’re proud of.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="band navy on-navy" id="how">
    <div class="wrap how-grid">
      <div class="stack">
        <p class="eyebrow">How practice works</p>
        <h2 class="h2" style="margin-top:0">Life takes reps.</h2>
        <p class="lede">Bring one thing. Let’s start there.</p>
        
      </div>
      <div class="cyc" role="img" aria-label="Circle of five steps: Begin, Learn, Practice, Reflect, Return, and back to Begin. One trip around is one rep.">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 600 600" aria-hidden="true"><defs><marker id="cah" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="6" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10z" fill="#CBB089"/></marker></defs>
          <circle cx="300" cy="300" r="234" fill="none" stroke="#F3EDE5" stroke-opacity=".1" stroke-width="2"/>
          <g fill="none" stroke="#CBB089" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M380.0 80.1 A234 234 0 0 1 484.4 155.9" marker-end="url(#cah)"/><path d="M533.9 308.2 A234 234 0 0 1 494.0 430.9" marker-end="url(#cah)"/><path d="M364.5 524.9 A234 234 0 0 1 235.5 524.9" marker-end="url(#cah)"/><path d="M106.0 430.9 A234 234 0 0 1 66.1 308.2" marker-end="url(#cah)"/><path d="M115.6 155.9 A234 234 0 0 1 220.0 80.1" marker-end="url(#cah)"/></g></svg>
        <div class="cyc-center"><b>That’s<br>one rep.</b><small>Then do it again.</small></div>
        <div class="cn first" style="left:50.0%;top:11.0%"><span class="lp-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 36 38" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 9h22a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v11a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H17l-7 6v-6H7a4 4 0 0 1-4-4V13a4 4 0 0 1 4-4z"/><path d="M11 17h14M11 22h9"/></svg><b>1</b></span><h4>Begin</h4><p>Bring a real life challenge to the Practice Coach.</p></div><div class="cn" style="left:87.1%;top:37.9%"><span class="lp-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 36 38" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 11c-4-3-9-3-14-2v20c5-1 10-1 14 2 4-3 9-3 14-2V9c-5-1-10-1-14 2z"/><path d="M18 11v20"/></svg><b>2</b></span><h4>Learn</h4><p>Get a short lesson or tool that fits the situation.</p></div><div class="cn" style="left:72.9%;top:81.6%"><span class="lp-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 36 38" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="18" cy="19" r="13"/><circle cx="18" cy="19" r="7"/><circle cx="18" cy="19" r="1.6" fill="currentColor"/></svg><b>3</b></span><h4>Practice</h4><p>Take one realistic action today. That’s a rep.</p></div><div class="cn" style="left:27.1%;top:81.6%"><span class="lp-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 36 38" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 6h16l5 5v20H8z"/><path d="M13 16h11M13 21h11M13 26h6"/></svg><b>4</b></span><h4>Reflect</h4><p>What happened, what you learned, what you’ll change.</p></div><div class="cn" style="left:12.9%;top:37.9%"><span class="lp-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 36 38" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M29 17a11 11 0 1 1-4-8.5"/><path d="M26 3v6h-6"/></svg><b>5</b></span><h4>Return</h4><p>See your progress and put in another rep.</p></div>
      </div>
      <ol class="loop-steps cyc-list"><li><span class="lp-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 36 38" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 9h22a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v11a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H17l-7 6v-6H7a4 4 0 0 1-4-4V13a4 4 0 0 1 4-4z"/><path d="M11 17h14M11 22h9"/></svg><b>1</b></span><h4>Begin</h4><p>Bring a real life challenge to the Practice Coach.</p></li><li><span class="lp-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 36 38" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 11c-4-3-9-3-14-2v20c5-1 10-1 14 2 4-3 9-3 14-2V9c-5-1-10-1-14 2z"/><path d="M18 11v20"/></svg><b>2</b></span><h4>Learn</h4><p>Get a short lesson or tool that fits the situation.</p></li><li><span class="lp-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 36 38" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="18" cy="19" r="13"/><circle cx="18" cy="19" r="7"/><circle cx="18" cy="19" r="1.6" fill="currentColor"/></svg><b>3</b></span><h4>Practice</h4><p>Take one realistic action today. That’s a rep.</p></li><li><span class="lp-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 36 38" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 6h16l5 5v20H8z"/><path d="M13 16h11M13 21h11M13 26h6"/></svg><b>4</b></span><h4>Reflect</h4><p>What happened, what you learned, what you’ll change.</p></li><li><span class="lp-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 36 38" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M29 17a11 11 0 1 1-4-8.5"/><path d="M26 3v6h-6"/></svg><b>5</b></span><h4>Return</h4><p>See your progress and put in another rep.</p></li></ol>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="band">
    <div class="wrap center">
      <p class="eyebrow">One practice. Four pathways.</p>
      <h2 class="h2">Learn it. Live it. Lead it. Scale it.</h2>
      <p class="lede" style="margin-top:16px">A complete ecosystem for individuals and organizations, built on the InnerBoard methodology.</p>
      <div class="pillars">
        <a class="pillar" href="/academy"><div class="ph photo"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1200" height="960" src="/images/practice/academy-books.webp" alt="Academy books on a shelf"></div><div class="body"><p class="eyebrow">Academy</p><h3>Learn it.</h3><p>Build the foundation. Understand the tools. Create real change.</p><span class="go">→</span></div></a>
        <a class="pillar" href="/lab"><div class="ph photo"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1000" height="563" src="/images/practice/lab-call.webp" alt="Members on a live coaching call"></div><div class="body"><p class="eyebrow">The Lab</p><h3>Live it.</h3><p>Apply the tools. Build new patterns. Make it part of your life.</p><span class="go">→</span></div></a>
        <a class="pillar" href="/inq"><div class="ph photo"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1400" height="788" src="/images/practice/leah-coaching.webp" alt="Leah Roling coaching two leaders at a table" style="object-position:52% 28%"></div><div class="body"><p class="eyebrow">INQ</p><h3>Lead it.</h3><p>Deepen your expertise. Expand your impact. Be part of what’s next.</p><span class="go">→</span></div></a>
        <a class="pillar" href="/ios"><div class="ph photo"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1400" height="788" src="/images/practice/leah-team.webp" alt="Leah and her team working together around a table" style="object-position:50% 35%"></div><div class="body"><p class="eyebrow">IOS</p><h3>Scale it.</h3><p>Bring self leadership into teams, culture, and organizations.</p><span class="go">→</span></div></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="band bone">
    <div class="wrap member">
      <div class="stack">
        <p class="eyebrow">The Practice membership</p>
        <h2 class="h2" style="margin-top:0">One membership. The whole practice.</h2>
        <p class="lede">When you join The Practice, the Academy and the Lab come with it, and the Practice Coach is with you the whole way.</p>
        <figure class="member-shot"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1000" height="563" src="/images/practice/lab-call.webp" alt="Members on a live coaching lab call"><figcaption>The Coaching Lab, included with your membership.</figcaption></figure>
        <div class="ctas"><a class="btn btn-solid" href={LINKS.startPracticing}>Start Practicing <span class="arr">→</span></a></div>
        <p class="member-note">INQ Certification and IOS for organizations are offered separately.</p>
      </div>
      <ul class="included">
        <li><span>Academy</span><div><b>The full course library</b><p>The Academy collections are included at no extra cost, from Foundations through Graduate.</p></div></li>
        <li><span>The Lab</span><div><b>The Coaching Lab and the Masterclass</b><p>The Coaching Lab, the monthly Masterclass, challenges, and community.</p></div></li>
        <li><span>Practice Coach</span><div><b>The Practice Coach, throughout</b><p>The Practice Coach is built into the lessons, the labs, and your day, so support is there between sessions.</p></div></li>
        <li><span>The Club</span><div><b>Membership in The Practice Club</b><p>Club challenges and the community of people doing the work.</p></div></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="club">
    <div class="merch merch-photos" aria-label="The Practice Club merch"><figure class="mph"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="600" height="800" src="/images/practice/merch-hoodie.webp" alt="Cream hoodie that reads The Practice Club"><figcaption>Hoodie</figcaption></figure><figure class="mph"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="600" height="800" src="/images/practice/merch-cap.webp" alt="Navy cap that reads Be Your Own Proof"><figcaption>Cap</figcaption></figure><figure class="mph"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="600" height="800" src="/images/practice/merch-tote.webp" alt="Canvas tote that reads Life Takes Reps"><figcaption>Tote</figcaption></figure><p class="tags merch-tag">Wear the work.</p></div>
    <div class="copy">
      <p class="tags">Community · Lifestyle · Merchandise · Belonging</p>
      <h2 class="club-h2"><DualImage src="/images/practice/club-logo.webp" dark="/images/practice/club-logo-light.webp" alt="The Practice Club, Est. 2026" width={700} height={273} /></h2>
      <p>For the people doing the work.</p>
      <p class="lede">The Practice is what you use. The Practice Club is what you belong to.</p>
      <p class="lede">When you join the Practice, you’re in the Club.</p>
      <a class="btn btn-line" href={LINKS.join} style="align-self:flex-start">Join the Club <span class="arr">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</Layout>
